11.
Duties of C. A. D. Circle and its Divisions.
- The duties of the C. A. D. Circle and its Divisions shall be as follows:-
(i)
Assuming responsibility for formation of Water Distribution Co-operative Societies;
(ii)
Disbursement of fund to Water Distribution Co-operative Societies as received from the Government and Union
Government;
(iii)
Providing technical assistance to Water Distribution Co-operative Societies;
(iv)
Maintenance of the accounts;
(v)
Maintenance of register of all agreements entered into between CAD establishment and Water Distribution Co-operative
