(vii)
Taking the execution of works of water courses and field channels of capacity not exceeding 0.042 cumec. discharge or
42 litres per second. Implementation of warabandhi. Agriculture demonstration and maintenance of accounts and
submission of accounts to Command Area Development Boards regularly;
(viii)
Operation and maintenance of the infrastructure transferred to them;
(ix)
Maintenance of water accounts;
(x)
Recovering of water rates from the farmers in its jurisdiction;
(xi)
Educating of farmers in applying new technology.
